          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FRenderAssetUpdate*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Cancel the current update. Will also attempt to cancel pending IO requests, see FTexture2DStreamIn_IO::Abort().\nThis is called outside of the update loop when a cancelation is required for external events."
